Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: fsl_sai: Clean code for synchronize mode
Date: Mon,  3 Aug 2020 11:17:54 +0800
Message-Id: <1596424674-32127-1-git-send-email-shengjiu.wang@nxp.com>
